join Zanele (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Zanele (Warm)
join Naledi (Neutral) left
Naledi: Head Teacher. Which she has been for eleven years without anybody writing it down.
Zanele: They have been calling me 'the teacher' for eleven years. I did not know I minded until it changed.
- It's about time
	Hope: It's about time.
	Zanele: It is about time. I would not have said so myself, and I am glad somebody did.
	Zanele: There is a practical part too, which is the part I keep thinking about. Head Teacher is a position. A position can be applied for, and funded, and filled by somebody else one day.
	Zanele: 'The teacher' was just me. If I had stopped, it would have stopped.
	Zanele: Now it does not stop when I do. That is worth more to me than the title.
[signal arg="hearts:zanele:3"]
set {GameState.quest_zanele_schoolhouse_opening} = "complete"
set {GameState.zanele_head_teacher} = true
